 13 |          <qianji:outputs>currentQuestion,currentChoices</qianji:outputs>
    |          `---------------- producer must declare structured choices schema
    |Help: Add `<qianji:outputSchema name="currentChoices" kind="choice_array" value="required" label="optional" description="optional"/>` after this qianji:outputs line.
    |Contract: qianji.bpmn.user_task.interaction.v1 requires dynamic choices producers to declare qianji:outputSchema kind="choice_array".

Proposed patch:
